 "remarks": "Desirable Stonewood condo rental with two bedrooms and two baths--all fully renovated in 2019. Spacious, open floor plan has wood flooring in living/dining area; walk-out deck; kitchen w/white shaker cabinets and gas stove; primary suite has walk-in closet, private bath w/double sinks and large shower stall; additional bedroom and bath; laundry room; 9' ceilings throughout; covered, gated parking garage with one reserved space and additional parking-outdoor lot. This is a no-smoking condo. Pets considered. Convenient location to shopping, restaurants, I95, Merritt and much more. Unit just painted, new carpeting in BRs, new hall bath vanity top. Softscreen Credit Report to be paid by tenants. Credit score 700+ Photos from listing prior to new carpeting and painting (photos w/captions are current)",
